    "detailed_description": "After a vicious storm, your boat crashes on a strange, little island. You awake, your boat no longer remotely near sea-worthy. As you come to, you hear a deep, rumbling voice in the distance and begin to notice strange, stone statues in unusual predicaments around the island. <br><br>Stumble around the tiny 'Moaisland' and interact with its strange inhabitants. Some will need your help, while others might want nothing to do with you. It's up to you to explore this little island, discover secrets and undo the vandalism done unto the Moai.<br><br><i>What will you uncover?</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861280/extras/96f0e4e1e93d9063a2a6dd9007be5dd4.poster.avif?t=1730484017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861280/extras/96f0e4e1e93d9063a2a6dd9007be5dd4.webm?t=1730484017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861280/extras/96f0e4e1e93d9063a2a6dd9007be5dd4.mp4?t=1730484017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A STRANGE ISLAND</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861280/extras/0de0b469705d8a83e2052c5f466e2691.poster.avif?t=1730484017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861280/extras/0de0b469705d8a83e2052c5f466e2691.webm?t=1730484017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861280/extras/0de0b469705d8a83e2052c5f466e2691.mp4?t=1730484017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELP THE MOAI</h2><span class=\"bb_img_c